{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write from Dresden, where I arrived yesterday evening after a tiring day in Töplitz. The journey is tedious, but the company here is better. I took dinner at Tiek’s and found myself in conversation with Professor Hinrichs, who is moving to Halle. He speaks well, but one senses the restlessness of a man uprooting himself. He left before I could ask him about the new chair, and I suspect he is more interested in his own departure than in the position.\n\nSchlegel was there as well. I did not know who he was until after he had gone. I heard he is a man of some reputation in the Romantic circle, but I confess I have little patience for those who turn philosophy into poetry. It is a pleasant confusion, I suppose, to meet a famous name only to realize you have missed the man.\n\nThe food was decent, the wine passable. I paid too much for the room, as is my custom. I hope the boys are well and that Ludwig is not causing trouble. I shall continue on to Vienna in a few days.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219084,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":242,"prompt_tokens":1102,"total_tokens":1344,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-n7epYlh8LKJfnHYudBDiJVaAwwxtTlmW","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1102,"prompt_ms":1164.41,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0566333938294012,"prompt_per_second":946.4020405183741,"predicted_n":242,"predicted_ms":5713.316,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.70670539419087,"predicted_per_second":42.18215831226559}}